      "content": "I get it, you're feeling like the universe is just a big, uncaring void. But sometimes, finding meaning isn't just a distraction—it's a way to cope with the overwhelming feelings of insignificance. The stars and planets will keep moving, and life will go on, but your existence, your struggles, and your joys matter to you. It's not about the universe caring, it's about finding a reason to keep going, even if it's just for you. Maybe it's not about the universe, but about making your own life a bit more bearable.",
